/*
 * Implements semantic validation for map comprehensions iterating over a slice.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - validating the element and index iterator variables,
 *   - constructing the loop inserting a pair at each iteration,
 *   - propagating the aliasing rules of the iterated slice.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::compose::mapfor::slice
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/compose/mapfor/slice.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-09-18
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
